WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.121 --> 00:00:14.701
Horn scowled at Wukong.

2
00:00:14.721 --> 00:00:18.143
"I doubt you have a gourd like mine."

3
00:00:19.763 --> 00:00:21.064
do," said Wukong.

4
00:00:22.425 --> 00:00:24.065
He held up the real gourd.

5
00:00:25.026 --> 00:00:26.786
The demon looked carefully at the gourd.

6
00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:30.288
does look like my gourd.

7
00:00:31.372 --> 00:00:33.554
But my gourd is magical."

8
00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:37.357
"My gourd is magical too," said Wukong.

9
00:00:38.217 --> 00:00:39.338
demon rubbed his chin.

10
00:00:39.358 --> 00:00:42.360
"What can your gourd do?"

11
00:00:43.601 --> 00:00:45.723
"It can hold a demon," said Wukong.

12
00:00:45.743 --> 00:00:48.425
"All I have to do is say the demon's name.

13
00:00:49.205 --> 00:00:51.667
The demon will get sucked in and then turn into liquid."

14
00:00:53.348 --> 00:00:54.950
Horn raised his eyebrows.

15
00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:59.280
"My gourd can do that too.

16
00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:01.681
see whose gourd works better.

17
00:01:02.902 --> 00:01:04.082
I'll go first.

18
00:01:06.483 --> 00:01:09.104
Um, I forgot your name."

19
00:01:10.425 --> 00:01:12.606
"Kong Sunwu," said Wukong.

20
00:01:13.946 --> 00:01:15.927
yes. Now I remember."

21
00:01:17.468 --> 00:01:19.188
Golden Horn held up his gourd.

22
00:01:19.208 --> 00:01:21.129
"Kong Sunwu!"

23
00:01:23.170 --> 00:01:24.150
Nothing happened.

24
00:01:26.391 --> 00:01:27.712
Horn looked at his gourd.

25
00:01:29.152 --> 00:01:31.953
"Why isn't my gourd working?"

26
00:01:32.033 --> 00:01:35.274
"Let me try mine," said Wukong.

27
00:01:35.294 --> 00:01:38.795
"Golden Horn!"

28
00:01:40.855 --> 00:01:43.196
Instantly the demon was sucked into the gourd.

29
00:01:45.017 --> 00:01:45.877
Wukong laughed.

30
00:01:46.617 --> 00:01:49.318
"Golden Horn will soon be turned into liquid!"

31
00:01:50.558 --> 00:01:53.279
He closed the gourd and ran into the cave.

32
00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:56.000
demons were inside.

33
00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:01.393
The monkey waved his iron bar at them.

34
00:02:02.453 --> 00:02:04.894
"Get out of here before I clobber you all!"

35
00:02:05.014 --> 00:02:05.655
he shouted.

36
00:02:05.675 --> 00:02:10.577
"Ahh!" The demons screamed and ran out of the cave.

37
00:02:13.678 --> 00:02:17.260
After a quick search of the cave, Wukong found his companions.

38
00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:22.902
"We thought you were trapped under mountains," said the Tang Monk.

39
00:02:24.383 --> 00:02:26.744
was freed a couple of hours ago," said Wukong.

40
00:02:28.608 --> 00:02:29.649
He untied the monk.

41
00:02:29.709 --> 00:02:32.351
"A couple of hours ago?"

42
00:02:32.831 --> 00:02:33.472
asked Bajie.

43
00:02:34.512 --> 00:02:36.354
were you doing for all that time?

44
00:02:37.074 --> 00:02:38.876
We were scared to death in here!"

45
00:02:40.997 --> 00:02:41.918
Wukong shrugged.

46
00:02:42.558 --> 00:02:43.759
couldn't free you right away.

47
00:02:43.779 --> 00:02:46.121
I had to get rid of the demon first."

48
00:02:49.283 --> 00:02:51.305
monkey untied Bajie and Wujing.

49
00:02:54.587 --> 00:02:58.064
They all went outside.

50
00:02:58.124 --> 00:03:00.785
"It's still early in the afternoon," said Wujing.

51
00:03:00.805 --> 00:03:02.885
"Let's start walking now."

52
00:03:02.905 --> 00:03:06.066
"Yes," said the Tang Monk.

53
00:03:07.007 --> 00:03:10.228
"I want to be as far from this mountain as I can by nighttime."

54
00:03:13.108 --> 00:03:15.309
The travelers hurried west along the road.

55
00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:20.170
They hadn't gone far when an old man approached them.

56
00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:24.272
"Give me back my gourd!"

57
00:03:24.652 --> 00:03:25.432
said the old man.

58
00:03:27.185 --> 00:03:27.965
stepped forward.

59
00:03:27.985 --> 00:03:29.707
"What gourd?

60
00:03:30.027 --> 00:03:30.808
I don't have a gourd."

61
00:03:32.269 --> 00:03:34.951
"I know you have my gourd," said the man.

62
00:03:34.971 --> 00:03:38.734
"I don't know what you're talking about," said the monkey.

63
00:03:39.655 --> 00:03:40.916
There was a flash of light.

64
00:03:42.697 --> 00:03:45.360
Laozi the sage stood before the travelers.

65
00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:47.121
He looked angry.

66
00:03:47.181 --> 00:03:49.763
"Give me my gourd, Wukong!"

67
00:03:50.024 --> 00:03:50.964
boomed the sage.

68
00:03:52.506 --> 00:03:55.028
laughed. "Relax, Laozi.

69
00:03:55.552 --> 00:03:57.053
I was just joking around.

70
00:03:58.214 --> 00:03:58.934
knew it was you.

71
00:03:59.474 --> 00:04:00.195
Here's your gourd."

72
00:04:01.495 --> 00:04:05.137
Wukong took the gourd out of his robe and handed it to the sage.

73
00:04:05.157 --> 00:04:09.700
"Why did that demon have your gourd?"

74
00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:10.661
asked the monkey.

75
00:04:10.681 --> 00:04:14.242
"Golden Horn works for me," said Laozi.

76
00:04:14.263 --> 00:04:16.704
"I sent him here to cause trouble for you.

77
00:04:17.504 --> 00:04:21.747
Buddha wanted to make sure you are all serious about reaching the Western Paradise.

78
00:04:22.767 --> 00:04:23.948
You fought well, Wukong."

79
00:04:25.672 --> 00:04:26.772
glanced at the gourd.

80
00:04:26.792 --> 00:04:30.033
"Golden Horn is probably all liquid by now."

81
00:04:31.774 --> 00:04:32.474
said Laozi.

82
00:04:32.874 --> 00:04:34.094
"The gourd won't harm him.

83
00:04:34.615 --> 00:04:37.255
Good-bye." The sage vanished.

84
00:04:42.757 --> 00:04:46.758
group continued west.

85
00:04:46.778 --> 00:04:49.119
As night fell they arrived at a monastery.

86
00:04:50.099 --> 00:04:53.920
After a small dinner with the monastery's monks, everyone went to bed.

87
00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:02.681
The Tang Monk was almost asleep when he heard a moaning sound from outside.

88
00:05:05.982 --> 00:05:08.163
monk sat up, trembling with fear.

89
00:05:09.083 --> 00:05:10.284
Was a ghost approaching?

90
00:05:12.744 --> 00:05:14.165
his door creaked open.

91
00:05:18.906 --> 00:05:21.107
A man stood in the doorway, dripping wet.

92
00:05:22.407 --> 00:05:24.628
looked at the monk and held out his hands.

93
00:05:27.365 --> 00:05:28.390
"Please help
